        "reveal": "⟨4, −3⟩: 3 + 4 = 7 and 4 + (−3) = 1. Addition is component-wise, so the second leg is the destination MINUS wherever the first leg already took you. The negative is not a special case — it is simply the part of the journey that heads back down."
      }
